# Channels on real MeshCore: Public works out of the box, a #hashtag channel
# joined from the UI matches one joined by another node, unread counts and
# muting behave.
# both-modes
node Dana 8
as Dana join #trailcrew
as Dana chan 0 Morning all, Public check
wait 3000
expect unread 1
shot chan-public-unread
# Join #trailcrew from the menu.
key menu
key enter
key enter
type trailcrew
key enter
wait 500
shot chan-joined
as Dana chan 1 Crew meets at 7
wait 3000
expect unread 2
key enter
shot chan-trailcrew
expect unread 1
type On my way
key enter
wait 2000
expect status sent
shot chan-sent
hold esc 900
key right 3
key down
key tab
key down
key enter
shot chan-muted
hold esc 900
as Dana chan 1 Muted message
wait 3000
expect unread 1
